WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:07.320
I am Prince of Jin of Xuan Kingdom Sikong Yao Sikong.

00:08.080 --> 00:11.440
He's Xuan Kingdom royalty send men immediately.

00:12.360 --> 00:16.360
If we capture him the battle can still turn.

00:17.720 --> 00:18.960
Capture him alive.

00:19.040 --> 00:21.400
Kill.

00:28.400 --> 00:33.200
Zu Kun, pressured by the court the Northern Expedition suffered a catastrophic setback, its supply lines severed. The generals harbored their own schemes, and the army's morale collapsed. Thenceforth, the northern war turned disastrously against Great Xuan.

00:33.280 --> 00:37.693
As a bargaining chip to end the war you were safely returned to the south.

00:38.680 --> 00:44.440
However soon after the northern expedition failed the claim that it was all your fault.

00:44.520 --> 00:47.080
Spread rapidly throughout the country.

01:06.360 --> 01:07.760
Prince.

01:14.560 --> 01:16.893
I am a traitor to the state.

01:18.840 --> 01:21.173
I am a traitor to the state.

01:22.840 --> 01:25.480
I am a traitor to the state.

01:27.000 --> 01:45.000
Refusing to endure captivity and disgrace, Prince of Jin Sikong Yao drew his own sword atop the falling ramparts, choosing death with honor for his kingdom.

